      "content": "Hello there, I'd be delighted to help you draft that email for your high-end brand. It is a bit of a logistical nightmare to manage customer expectations, but we can certainly handle it with the polish and empathy you need.\n\nHere is a draft that acknowledges the delay at the Memphis sorting facility, offers a sincere apology, and clearly confirms the shipping refund while maintaining your brand's premium tone.\n\n***\n\n**Subject:** Important Update Regarding Your Midnight Recovery Serum Order #[Order Number]\n\nDear [Customer Name],\n\nI am writing to personally address the delay in your Midnight Recovery Serum, which has unfortunately arrived four days later than our promised delivery window. We understand that in the world of high-end skincare, timing is everything, and a missed delivery date can feel like a significant disruption to your routine. Please accept our deepest apologies for this inconvenience; it was not our intention to let you down.\n\nThe delay was caused by an unexpected logistical bottleneck at our Memphis sorting facility, where a surge in volume temporarily stalled our processing lines. While we are currently working tirelessly to rectify the situation, we recognize that this is not the standard of service you deserve.\n\nTo make this right, we are immediately processing a full refund for your shipping costs",
